  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder, multiprofile settings, and transformer aggregation achieve high accuracy (0.653). Multimodal models with these components but singleprofile and concat fusion underperform (0.536). This experiment tests whether combining scvi_n200 RNA, resnet50 image encoders, multiprofile settings, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (the best-performing components from RNA-only and multimodal experiments) can surpass the RNA-only baseline. It isolates the effect of multimodal fusion strategies and profile settings, addressing uncertainty about whether multimodal approaches can outperform unimodal ones when using optimal components."
}

